@baseUrl = https://gateway.your-domain.com
@appKey = REPLACE_WITH_THIS_APPLICATIONS_KEY
@jobId = REPLACE_WITH_THE_RETURNED_JOB_ID

### Compatible with your existing number/message JSON
POST {{baseUrl}}/sms-send/
Authorization: Bearer {{appKey}}
Idempotency-Key: notification-001
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "number": "+639171234567",
  "message": "Hello from my application!"
}

### Status for the same application
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/sms/{{jobId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{appKey}}

### Gateway connection and modem readiness report
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/health
Authorization: Bearer {{appKey}}

### List this application's jobs
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/sms?page=0&limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{appKey}}

### Cancel only if still queued
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/sms/{{jobId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{appKey}}
